    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Duplicate seal</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">48</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; background-color: White">
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">When and how seal is to be used</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">48</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">If no seal is adopted or used</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">48</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; background-color: White">
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Power to allow non-manual signatures
    and facsimile printing of seal</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">48</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Validity of execution</FONT></TD>
